{
  "sn51.10:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 51.10 ",
  "sn51.10:0.2": "1. Cāpālavagga ",
  "sn51.10:0.3": "Cetiyasutta ",
  "sn51.10:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn51.10:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā vesāliyaṁ viharati mahāvane kūṭāgārasālāyaṁ. ",
  "sn51.10:1.3": "Atha kho bhagavā pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya vesāliṁ piṇḍāya pāvisi. ",
  "sn51.10:1.4": "Vesāliyaṁ piṇḍāya caritvā pacchābhattaṁ piṇḍapātapaṭikkanto āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn51.10:1.5": "“gaṇhāhi, ānanda, nisīdanaṁ. ",
  "sn51.10:1.6": "Yena cāpālaṁ cetiyaṁ tenupasaṅkamissāma divāvihārāyā”ti. ",
  "sn51.10:1.7": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho āyasmā ānando bhagavato paṭissutvā nisīdanaṁ ādāya bhagavantaṁ piṭṭhito piṭṭhito anubandhi. ",
  "sn51.10:2.1": "Atha kho bhagavā yena cāpālaṁ cetiyaṁ tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā paññatte āsane nisīdi. ",
  "sn51.10:2.2": "Āyasmāpi kho ānando bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. ",
  "sn51.10:2.3": "Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn51.10:3.1": "“Ramaṇīyā, ānanda, vesālī, ramaṇīyaṁ udenaṁ cetiyaṁ, ramaṇīyaṁ gotamakaṁ cetiyaṁ, ramaṇīyaṁ sattambaṁ cetiyaṁ, ramaṇīyaṁ bahuputtaṁ cetiyaṁ, ramaṇīyaṁ sārandadaṁ cetiyaṁ, ramaṇīyaṁ cāpālaṁ cetiyaṁ. ",
  "sn51.10:3.2": "Yassa kassaci, ānanda, cattāro iddhipādā bhāvitā bahulīkatā yānīkatā v